# RX-010: Changing the zinc half-cell shifts Daniell voltage in the opposite direction
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 ZnSO4 0.001mol
add v1 Zn 1g
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v2 Cu 1g
cell v1 v2
add v1 ZnSO4 0.009mol
cell v1 v2
inspect
